-- ============================================================================
-- EC4 PROFESSIONAL DEEP SEED: Decision Analysis & Value of Information,
-- intermediate tier.
--
-- Six modules, 26 lessons, 132 questions (15 per module bank plus a 42
-- question final exam). The structure row is GENERATED from the tier's
-- manifest.json rather than hand typed.
--
-- What this tier owns: WHAT INFORMATION IS WORTH. Perfect information and
-- EVPI; imperfect information by Bayes (likelihoods, signal chances,
-- posteriors, the best action after each reading, EVII between 0 and EVPI);
-- buying it (gross and net, the information tree, the neutral price, a cost
-- sweep); accuracy and value; and the VOI Analyzer (two actions, typed
-- percents, the inversion to likelihoods, four cards for five numbers).
--
-- THE ENGINE FACT THIS TIER OWNS. Information is worth exactly what it can
-- change in the choice: a survey whose every reading leads to the same action
-- is worth 0 however much it moves the posterior.
--
-- THE TRAP THE TIER IS BUILT ON. A likelihood is not a posterior, and the
-- Analyzer's two actions are not the full decision: both mistakes produce a
-- confident, wrong value of information.
-- ============================================================================

